Subject: [PATCH 11/12] doc: add SM90 (Hopper) setup and results

Add doc/sm90.md: which kernels are substituted on SM90 and what each
was checked against, how to build and run (build.sh, the SM90 settings
and their defaults), the TTFT / decode / GSM8K results on H20-3e, and
the known limitations. README.md lists SM90 under supported hardware
with a link to it.

